    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodgibi is a roguelite where everything wants to get you. Dodge ennemies attacks, collect feathers, discover new maps, fight bosses and unlock all characters with their unique abilities!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUTE COLORFUL CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/428c6eeb3974f254654e511bb3ff079e.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/428c6eeb3974f254654e511bb3ff079e.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as cute chibi characters in a colorful world! Each character has his own ability that will help you to survive in this dangerous climate. Find the one that suits you best and use it to beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE &amp; COLLECT FEATHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/8c9c0dcfe6a5defa7f5c3be01ca162ee.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/8c9c0dcfe6a5defa7f5c3be01ca162ee.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is attacking you! Dodge enemies and try to collect all the feathers! The more feathers you have, the more enemies there will be to dodge. Retry until you get enough feathers to move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/40567c221e36b308d68a78a877b18ac5.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/40567c221e36b308d68a78a877b18ac5.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have collected enough feathers without getting hit, a boss appear and it's his turn to try to get you! Dodge him, collect shards and then strike back to get to the next map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u00a0 unlockable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in the next big update</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new map </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new boss</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodgibi is a roguelite where everything wants to get you. Dodge ennemies attacks, collect feathers, discover new maps, fight bosses and unlock all characters with their unique abilities!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUTE COLORFUL CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/428c6eeb3974f254654e511bb3ff079e.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/428c6eeb3974f254654e511bb3ff079e.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as cute chibi characters in a colorful world! Each character has his own ability that will help you to survive in this dangerous climate. Find the one that suits you best and use it to beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE &amp; COLLECT FEATHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/8c9c0dcfe6a5defa7f5c3be01ca162ee.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/8c9c0dcfe6a5defa7f5c3be01ca162ee.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is attacking you! Dodge enemies and try to collect all the feathers! The more feathers you have, the more enemies there will be to dodge. Retry until you get enough feathers to move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/40567c221e36b308d68a78a877b18ac5.poster.avif?t=1753571016\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737030/extras/40567c221e36b308d68a78a877b18ac5.webm?t=1753571016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have collected enough feathers without getting hit, a boss appear and it's his turn to try to get you! Dodge him, collect shards and then strike back to get to the next map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About this game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u00a0 unlockable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in the next big update</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new map </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 new enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 new boss</p></li></ul>",
